ould have prevented it. Deliberately NOT fixed in code: the check must keep firing on an unconfirmed final CLEAN regardless of how well-reasoned the waiver text is, because auto-passing on a non-null confirmation_waived would let any run mute the double-CLEAN gate with its own prose.]
